    "Review items before removal.\nYou can restore files from the Trash while they remain there.": {
      "comment": "Welcome screen. Files that are permanently deleted cannot be restored. Recovery from Trash is possible only while the files are there.",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revisa los elementos antes de eliminarlos.\nPuedes recuperar los archivos que Moppo traslada a la Papelera hasta que la vacíes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérifiez les éléments avant de les supprimer.\nVous pouvez récupérer les fichiers que Moppo place dans la Corbeille jusqu’à ce que vous la vidiez."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Controlla gli elementi prima di rimuoverli.\nPuoi ripristinare i file finché si trovano nel Cestino."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review the application again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Revisa la aplicación de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Vérifiez de nouveau l’application."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Verifica di nuovo l’applicazione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review the application to try again. If removal still fails, run the copied command in Terminal for more details.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Revisa la aplicación para volver a intentarlo. Si la eliminación sigue fallando, ejecuta el comando copiado en Terminal para ver más detalles."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Vérifiez l’application pour réessayer. Si la suppression échoue de nouveau, exécutez la commande copiée dans Terminal pour en savoir plus."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Esamina di nuovo l’applicazione. Se la rimozione non riesce ancora, esegui il comando copiato in Terminale per altri dettagli."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review this item before removal. You may need its contents.": {
