          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This moves %@ of downloaded sound content to the Trash. Your application and music projects stay on this Mac. Projects that use these sounds may need another download. Empty the Trash to recover disk space.": {
      "comment": "Emptying the Trash permanently deletes its contents. Use the macOS name for the Trash.",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta acción traslada %@ de sonidos descargados a la Papelera. Tu app y tus proyectos musicales siguen en el Mac. Es posible que los proyectos que usan estos sonidos tengan que descargarlos otra vez. Vacía la Papelera para recuperar espacio en disco."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cette action place %@ de contenu audio téléchargé dans la corbeille. L’application et les projets musicaux restent sur ce Mac. Les projets qui utilisent ces sons peuvent nécessiter un nouveau téléchargement. Videz la corbeille pour récupérer de l’espace."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Questa azione sposta nel Cestino %@ di contenuti audio scaricati. L’applicazione e i progetti musicali restano su questo Mac. I progetti che usano questi suoni potrebbero doverli riscaricare. Svuota il Cestino per recuperare spazio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This plan needs a specialized review. Use the existing Cleanup or App Uninstaller controls for these items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Este plan requiere una revisión específica. Usa los controles de Limpieza o Desinstalador de apps para estos elementos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ce plan demande une vérification spécifique. Utilisez les commandes de Nettoyage ou de Désinstallation d’apps pour ces éléments."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Questo piano richiede una verifica specifica. Usa i controlli di Pulizia o Disinstallazione app per questi elementi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This proposal is separate from your current Cleanup selection. No removal starts until you confirm it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
